page DeployPage
  Section id:"deploy-introduction" py:{ xs:6 md:10 }
    Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:"1fr auto" } gap:5 align:"end"
      Grid columns:1 gap:3
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DEVELOPMENT / PRODUCTION DEPLOY"
        Title size:{ xs:"3xl" md:"6xl" } weight:"black"
          "Dowe Deploy"
        Text size:"lg" color:"muted"
          "Build native release artifacts, publish mobile apps, or deploy to Dowe Cloud, Docker, SSH, and Cloudflare."
      Button:
        href:"/docs/dev/install"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"primary"
        size:"sm"
        rounded:"full"
        iconStart:"upload"
        "Install Dowe"
  Section id:"deploy-command" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "CAPABILITY-AWARE MENU"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Choose a configured surface"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Run deploy from the project root. Select Live, Stage, or UAT before the deploy surface; Android and iOS remain Live-only."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy commands"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          dowe login
          dowe deploy
          dowe deploy server --target dowe --publish
          dowe deploy web --target dowe --publish
          dowe deploy server --target ssh --publish --host server.example.com --user deploy --key-file $HOME/.ssh/id_ed25519
          dowe deploy server --environment stage --target docker --registry ghcr.io/acme --image clinic
          dowe deploy --environment uat --target cloudflare --name clinic-api
          dowe deploy web --environment live --name clinic-web --publish
          dowe deploy --target android --track internal --publish
          dowe deploy --target ios --publish
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "SERVER"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Dowe Cloud, Docker, SSH, or Cloudflare Worker"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Dowe Cloud uploads a verified application binary. Docker creates a native Linux image. SSH installs one executable as a Debian or Ubuntu systemd service. Cloudflare Worker keeps Dowe-owned Wasm lowering."
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Run dowe login once to validate and save the dashboard API token, or use DOWE_CLOUD_TOKEN in CI."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "WEB"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Dowe Cloud or Cloudflare Pages"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Pages packages the generated web distribution and can publish it with Wrangler."
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Project assets stay available under /assets, including social images referenced only by SEO metadata."
  Section id:"deploy-environment" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DEPLOY ENVIRONMENTS"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Deploy without rewriting .env"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "dowe dev uses .env. Deploy selects .env.live, .env.stage, or .env.uat, while dowe build always uses .env.live. Ignore every local value file and declare shared names in .env.example."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Client configuration"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Values referenced from Views are compiled from the selected profile into the output. The process environment has higher precedence and Dowe never falls back to another profile."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Server secrets"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Dotenv profiles are never copied into a package. Stage and UAT require the server-only DOWE_DEPLOY_ACCESS_PASSWORD; Live does not include that access middleware."
  Section id:"native-builds" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "NATIVE RELEASE ARTIFACTS"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Build without publishing"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "dowe build writes release artifacts under .dowe/dist/build. iOS and macOS are available only when Dowe runs on macOS."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy build commands"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          dowe build --target android
          dowe build --target ios
          dowe build --target macos
          dowe build --target windows
          dowe build --target linux
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "MOBILE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "APK and IPA"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Android downloads and verifies its pinned Gradle Wrapper, creates and reuses a private project keystore automatically, streams Gradle progress, then produces a signed release APK. A global Gradle installation is not required. iOS embeds its distribution profile and produces a signed IPA."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "DESKTOP"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "DMG, EXE, and Linux"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Windows builds run on Windows and Linux builds run on Linux. Each appends a verified Dowe app bundle to the installed Dowe executable without Tauri, .NET, C, Cargo, Docker, or project target SDKs."
            Text
              "iOS builds automatically match an Apple signing identity from the Keychain with a compatible provisioning profile managed by Xcode. Environment overrides remain available for CI."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "SAFE PLANS"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Dry run"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Add --dry-run to materialize manifests and inspect commands without running toolchains or contacting a store."
  Section id:"mobile-stores" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "MOBILE STORES"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Upload an already signed release"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Google Play receives an Android App Bundle through an edit. App Store Connect receives the signed IPA through Xcode's upload adapter. Non-interactive publication requires --publish."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Google Play"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Set Android signing variables and DOWE_GOOGLE_PLAY_ACCESS_TOKEN. Increment DOWE_APP_BUILD_NUMBER for each upload; the default track is internal."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "App Store Connect"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "On macOS, set the iOS signing profile and identity plus the App Store API key and issuer."
  Section id:"deploy-docker" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "NATIVE DOCKER RUNTIME"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Tag the image you intend to run"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Interactive Docker asks for a registry and image name. docker.io and the project folder provide safe defaults."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "REGISTRY"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "docker.io"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Use Docker Hub, ghcr.io, a private host, or a registry with a port."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "IMAGE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "project:latest"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Dowe adds latest when the selected image name does not contain a tag."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "PLATFORM"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "linux/amd64"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The current native runtime and generated build command target Linux amd64."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy structure"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          .dowe/dist/docker/
            Dockerfile
            deploy.json
            app/
              main.dowe
              theme.dowe
              .env.example
              assets/
        """
  Section id:"deploy-runtime" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DISTROLESS / NONROOT"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Ship one Dowe binary, not the toolchain"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "The final image contains the app and the Linux dowe executable. It does not contain Cargo, rustc, a shell, or Node.js."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "One native executable"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The same dowe binary runs development commands and the production-only server subcommand."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Immutable release archive"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The Dockerfile downloads the versioned Linux archive and extracts dowe without requiring Dowe on the user machine."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy entrypoint"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"/usr/local/bin/dowe server --root /app --bind 0.0.0.0:8080"
  Section id:"deploy-ssh" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "SSH / SYSTEMD"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Install one native server executable"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "SSH deploy embeds the selected Dowe application in the same-version Linux amd64 runtime, uploads it with OpenSSH, and enables a background systemd service."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Password or key"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "OpenSSH owns password and key-passphrase prompts. Dowe stores neither and keeps normal host-key verification enabled."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Debian or Ubuntu"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The remote installer rejects other distributions, non-amd64 hosts, missing systemd, or accounts without sudo access."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Background service"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "systemctl enable --now starts the app immediately, enables boot startup, and restarts it after a failure."
  Section id:"deploy-build-result" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "SAFE FALLBACK"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Keep the context when Docker is unavailable"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Dowe always writes the context first. A working daemon builds and tags the image; a missing client or daemon leaves a usable Dockerfile for later."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Daemon available"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Dowe runs docker build for linux/amd64 with the full registry and image tag."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Daemon unavailable"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Deploy succeeds and reports that no local image was built."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Dry run"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The context and command are produced without executing Docker."
  Section id:"deploy-boundaries" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "CURRENT BOUNDARIES"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Four Server providers, one shared Dowe authority"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Dowe Cloud, Docker, SSH, and Cloudflare continue through the shared deploy API used by CLI and IPC. The former Linux host package remains retired."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Secrets stay outside"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              ".env, .env.live, .env.stage, and .env.uat are never copied. Declare names in .env.example and provide runtime server values through the platform."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Push stays explicit"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Dowe tags the local Docker image but does not log in or push it to the registry."
